    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new puzzle action game where you gather Clone humans and lead them to the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll face many tricks and gimmicks, like blocks that can only be moved with a certain number of clones. Collect as many hidden coins as you can and aim for the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the blue Clone humans and head for the goal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">White Clone humans are scattered throughout the stage. Find them and make them your allies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stages are packed with gimmicks like moving blocks and elevators!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to minimize sacrifices among the Clone humans!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some blocks require a specific number of clones to move!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage has 3 hidden coins! Gather as many as you can before reaching the goal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 meticulously designed stages are waiting for you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controller</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Left Stick</strong>: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Right Stick</strong>: Rotate camera (left/right), zoom (forward/backward)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>B</strong>: Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Y</strong>: Gather Clone humans</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keyboard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WASD</strong>: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arrow Keys (\u2190\u2192)</strong>: Rotate camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arrow Keys (\u2191\u2193)</strong>: Zoom camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space</strong>: Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>E</strong>: Gather Clone humans</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new puzzle action game where you gather Clone humans and lead them to the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll face many tricks and gimmicks, like blocks that can only be moved with a certain number of clones. Collect as many hidden coins as you can and aim for the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the blue Clone humans and head for the goal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">White Clone humans are scattered throughout the stage. Find them and make them your allies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stages are packed with gimmicks like moving blocks and elevators!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to minimize sacrifices among the Clone humans!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some blocks require a specific number of clones to move!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage has 3 hidden coins! Gather as many as you can before reaching the goal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 meticulously designed stages are waiting for you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controller</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Left Stick</strong>: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Right Stick</strong>: Rotate camera (left/right), zoom (forward/backward)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>B</strong>: Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Y</strong>: Gather Clone humans</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keyboard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WASD</strong>: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arrow Keys (\u2190\u2192)</strong>: Rotate camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arrow Keys (\u2191\u2193)</strong>: Zoom camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space</strong>: Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>E</strong>: Gather Clone humans</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A puzzle action game where Clone humans race through stages aiming for the goal! Move blocks that are impossible to handle alone by teaming up with everyone! Bring as many clones as possible to the goal!",
